_japEUskMhwr30muow2z3906ZaIeiJeoLOmH1nChu6uw&oe=6A3D45C4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u-4cxe5SnLUQ7kNvwH-nBrl&_nc_oc=AdpYdghPlu5nkZlZLt-0bG0-V1YpWG6_ZnN93mkqKswZWo4hACBhK0E-5PibEBZ6PKE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_vnsNniFitFBIUqz1azXjCf9eAyOS_u6Mt8ZQoEZ9LVQ&oe=6A3D2A62"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GQA1MQfeKYIQ7kNvwHdpiys&_nc_oc=AdrfFR-CwMWfx8HjpK1Oahw5aGutuITfTm_xF9upAzKXEh9UJf77DnooLmf2t7UkIK8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-79c2E7aU2OlAQJI-F5xyiTRiusHXqF7Ei56vF2EKbQg&oe=6A3D4CB3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NJhhIyb9z-UQ7kNvwHeIDN-&_nc_oc=AdqcTl4wm_kgrdRlmQbbtpvmDjMFlWxv8V2L0a6dc-gyhJkTvFF7hPBtNfzbNP55KGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9j6CnOCwkoCvUiyX4v7rYpoevzeAQaOjYoIK7Jrc7Iyg&oe=6A3D4BAF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nw7-df-V050Q7kNvwG4VKZ8&_nc_oc=AdpbLMf_sJiH8F2xbkVEdPLa9QtGqVrletob6AkZl14NOZ9uRQPIxXAIYPSJHM3Wrsc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8ecglzg9LSmWMP5y5_VRIig1oWG46IQ-d3Z5Y2-rxUvA&oe=6A3D47A5"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w19PK5vF-TIQ7kNvwFDc35O&_nc_oc=Adrpbaig_g_HRvuB6MbjgAjTqLZDHFrAYiada7PqxrCvdRXjvcel0ULngsWm_AcHqpI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-6Vjn5va7wdxxxeSNR70dJ67eOCQiBb0sVcFDLAQkgzQ&oe=6A3D468D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ByUqvsrSJiEQ7kNvwFVeFBR&_nc_oc=AdonKZTOYdNk2l1eLIZ9P7J_FVuUgEHUUq-egi0dB68RdbDsZOZyuVkW7FJJSWH1Dh8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=